
=== touchpad record: reading libinput record ===
  ok   reads the device name and every evdev row of a libinput record
  ok   refuses a record of several devices, an empty one and a malformed row
  ok   writes a record it reads back event for event, with its expectations

=== touchpad record: replaying into the decoder ===
  ok   (touchpad-record) a recorded session decodes into its gestures on recorded time
  ok   (touchpad-record) every kept trace decodes into the gestures it declares
